Package: attest
Title: Check Whether Expression Data Can Support the Claims Made From It
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Amir", "Shahbazi", email = "amirshahbazi580@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Audits an RNA-seq count matrix before differential expression.
    It does not analyse expression; it adjudicates whether the data can
    support the analysis about to be run on it, reporting a verdict, the
    evidence behind it, and any check the inputs could not answer.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports: methods, stats, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), SummarizedExperiment
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
